  "extractionNotes": "Same insurance history as B1-02 (very likely the same person). Pregnancy sickness benefit (code B) had been paid from 2024-10-17; the continuation e-ZLA 2025-03-04..2025-03-31 was examined on 2025-03-04 and ZUS found a debt on the business owner's account (TAK); case closed with a refusal, decision text not in the file. The memo also records that the debt was later repaid in full on a date in summer 2025, after the claimed spell; the refusal reflects the state at the decision, so the repayment date is not put into facts (asOf = examination date). The child was born during the claimed spell (2025-03-21, see B1-02), which would end sickness benefit on 2025-03-20 anyway; the event date is not in this file, so the event is left undated and mode is set to adjudication. Plan block = the continuation as claimed."
